Backport upstream "Fix calculation of dex header signature" by Kevin Sun.
https://r8.googlesource.com/r8/+/634b3eaec7fc3d8b0a293039011ec889d0d045d1

The original length subtracts the field-ID offset instead of the file-size
offset, leaving the last 52 bytes outside the SHA-1 calculation.

